==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1 & 2'''===
Kill the starting Mooth with [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]], which will give you a good amount of cash. After that, stall I.M. Phace until the first General GreGory comes out. Once you kill him, use Butterfly against the second Mooth and at that point you should have enough money to send out whatever you want. All that is left to do is to kill the last 2 Gregories and eventually kill I.M Phace.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Almost everything is kept the same in Chapter 3, except for the Helmut Krabbes and Mooths being replaced by UltraBaaBaas. Be sure to bring a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|barrier breaker unit]] like [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fencer Cat]] to deal with the UltraBaaBaas, and anti-alien rares/specials to deal with the General GreGories, preferably [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]], as they can deal with the Kroxos as well. Use [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]](when you have the cash) to slowly defeat the alien face.

[[Courier Cat]] can destroy this stage by using the initial UltraBaaBaa as a stepping stone.

If you haven't already, it is recommended to collect all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] available up to this point, or else the immense buffs on the Starred Aliens will be too much to handle.

